{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"c":1,"x":0.82056625005606976,"t":"Reading","y":0.039519847795296603,"w":0.08341386795043948,"h":0.019211106582594062},{"w":0.7980582682291667,"x":0.069902904540814839,"c":1,"t":"gases. I don't much like the fact, either, that they've travelled an average of 2,000 refrigerated","y":0.08866279096835028,"h":0.018895348284474811},{"t":"kilometres to my plate, that their quality is so poor, because the varieties are selected for their","y":0.10753998018890187,"h":0.020047194341261454,"c":1,"x":0.069845705484014212,"w":0.79621749877929693},{"y":0.12599375057451501,"w":0.83314320882161452,"h":0.020462459195811356,"t":"capacity to withstand such substantial journeys, or that 80% of the price I pay goes to wholesalers","x":0.069834673860139376,"c":1},{"x":0.067864453165172117,"y":0.14385497469500075,"w":0.38276725769042963,"h":0.021293397707359829,"c":1,"t":"and transport companies, not the producers.'"},{"c":1,"t":"Produce grown using this soil-free method, on the other hand - which relies solely on a small","y":0.18313953477047407,"h":0.017483518131054088,"x":0.067961174555239839,"w":0.79611648559570314},{"h":0.02166963618863782,"w":0.77883646647135407,"t":"quantity of water, enriched with organic nutrients, pumped around a closed circuit of pipes,","c":1,"y":0.19929735569981621,"x":0.067882282254459858},{"c":1,"t":"towers and trays - is 'produced up here, and sold locally, just down there. It barely travels at all,'","y":0.21947674365827829,"x":0.066019426278722718,"h":0.020398645608967314,"w":0.82718444824218751},{"c":1,"t":"Hardy says. 'You can select crop varieties for their flavour, not their resistance to the transport","h":0.0188953482844747,"x":0.067961172770159992,"w":0.80194173177083328,"y":0.2369186049217693},{"h":0.0188953482844747,"x":0.067961155321122443,"y":0.25726744213439745,"w":0.80388351440429695,"t":"and storage chain, and you can pick them when they're really at their best, and not before.' No","c":1},{"t":"soil is exhausted, and the water that gently showers the plants' roots every 12 minutes is recycled,","y":0.27244669839908375,"w":0.83520268758138017,"c":1,"x":0.06785497197535259,"h":0.024114431696146021},{"y":0.29501557643190768,"w":0.70679611206054682,"c":1,"t":"so the method uses 90% less water than a classic intensive farm for the same yield.","h":0.017484423676012439,"x":0.06796116717302525},{"h":0.017514308442207804,"c":1,"t":"Urban farming is not, of course, a new phenomenon. Inner-city agriculture is booming from","w":0.78058252970377606,"y":0.33139534872370624,"x":0.069902909773749591},{"c":1,"t":"Shanghai to Detroit and Tokyo to Bangkok. Strawberries are being grown in disused shipping","h":0.020621812529281636,"y":0.34866860498324703,"w":0.79817082722981769,"x":0.06790765912873041},{"t":"containers, mushrooms in underground carparks. Aeroponic farming, he says, is 'virtuous'. The","y":0.3676012464624614,"h":0.020560747663551426,"c":1,"x":0.06796116939550273,"w":0.81359222412109355},{"c":1,"x":0.067888659591921599,"w":0.81374354044596364,"y":0.38651529946857166,"t":"equipment weighs little, can be installed on almost any flat surface and is cheap to buy: roughly","h":0.020793780508071125},{"y":0.40685358262133786,"h":0.019018510123279597,"w":0.82330098470052071,"x":0.067961158036222005,"c":1,"t":"€100 to €150 per square metre. It is cheap to run, too, consuming a tiny fraction of the electricity"},{"y":0.42429906525781091,"h":0.017561399156802215,"x":0.067961164357609863,"w":0.22135922749837245,"c":1,"t":"used by some techniques."},{"x":0.067865284077002652,"w":0.82347529093424476,"h":0.021456708343601028,"y":0.46093185143910675,"c":1,"t":"Produce grown this way typically sells at prices that, while generally higher than those of classic"},{"h":0.017549627072343199,"t":"intensive agriculture, are lower than soil-based organic growers. There are limits to what farmers","c":1,"y":0.4809968846624153,"x":0.066019426189915006,"w":0.8271844482421874},{"x":0.067961184350712259,"y":0.49844236746178283,"w":0.79805821736653637,"t":"can grow this way, of course, and much of the produce is suited to the summer months. 'Root","h":0.019003115264797477,"c":1},{"h":0.02263471538032702,"t":"vegetables we cannot do, at least not yet,' he says. 'Radishes are OK, but carrots, potatoes, that","x":0.067865405369608903,"y":0.51604908990240128,"w":0.80989364624023419,"c":1},{"h":0.019930614340713859,"x":0.067888945431365172,"c":1,"w":0.81177627563476551,"t":"kind of thing - the roots are simply too long. Fruit trees are obviously not an option. And beans","y":0.5356751989799492},{"x":0.065913167688724739,"t":"tend to take up a lot of space for not much return.' Nevertheless, urban farming of the kind","y":0.55190326853040228,"w":0.77301218668619787,"h":0.023238420337902799,"c":1},{"h":0.020155669595593562,"c":1,"t":"being practised in Paris is one part of a bigger and fast-changing picture that is bringing food","x":0.065942771410460441,"y":0.57312681669055676,"w":0.79237431844075523},{"y":0.5930232559025248,"h":0.016011012306094474,"w":0.26019416809082035,"c":1,"t":"production closer to our lives.","x":0.066019420707908671},{"t":"17","y":0.95784883707188639,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"x":0.87184466092964541,"w":0.031067959467569906}]}